{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/library_hero.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a serene world where numbers and strategy intertwine. <strong>PhiloDeka</strong> is a unique and meticulously crafted card Roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/GIF_-_play_cards.gif?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll cleverly combine the number cards in your hand to form multiples of 10, earning generous rewards. To master this art, you need to delve into the game's unique core systems. Every combination and decision embodies the pure joy of 'planning and reaping'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_1.png?t=1746537075\" /><strong>Core Gameplay &amp; Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/GIF_-_highlight_-_en.gif?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge ever-changing strategic combinations using the three core elements: <strong>Runes</strong>, <strong>Rune Stones</strong>, and <strong>Rune Skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_2.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Runes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each <strong>Rune</strong> boasts a distinct style, granting unique bonuses and build directions, and growing stronger as they level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/GIF_-_rune_and_skills_-_en.gif?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_2.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rune Stones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire and upgrade <strong>Rune Stones</strong> in the random shop; they interact deeply with <strong>Runes</strong>, triggering chain effects for generous boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/GIF_-_shop_stones_-_en.gif?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_2.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rune Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flexibly alter card numbers to precisely activate <strong>Rune Stone</strong> bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/GIF_-_skill_-_en.gif?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleverly combine and layer these three elements to discover and refine your ultimate personal strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_1.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Random Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/cards.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite Exploration: Randomly generated hands and shops ensure every journey is filled with unknowns and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic Evolution: Continuously experiment in ever-changing challenges, hone and refine your playstyle, pushing strategic depth to its limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_1.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immersive Experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist Aesthetic: Simple, soft visual design creates a serene atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing Music: Soothing background music accompanies your thought process, helping you immerse yourself in the realm of combination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/logo_yi.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join <strong>PhiloDeka</strong>, sculpt your unique build in random adventures, and in the Zen of numbers, find your harmony and perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692960/extras/divider_1.png?t=1746537075\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Rune Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 40 Rune Stones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 Levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Limitations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save data is not synchronized with Steam and will not be inherited by the full version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Content may be adjusted with updates.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692960?t=1746537075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692960?t=1746537075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass